FRAME_RUN.InstallInfo=Service frame basic component.
SYSTEM_RUN.InstallInfo=System management component.
ITM_RUN.InstallInfo=A unified interface is provided to manage the NMS timing tasks and service related tasks in a centralized manner.
APP_RUN.InstallInfo=Provides the functions of running remote tasks and downloading. 

